{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果於11月19日向公眾測試者推送了 iOS 27.3、iPadOS 27.3、macOS Golden Gate 27.3、tvOS 27.3 和 watchOS 27.3 的第二個公測版本。與此同時，蘋果也向開發者提供了 iOS 27.3 和 iPadOS 27.3 的修訂版測試版本。這些更新預計將於12月正式發佈。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587214.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:01.936506+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:10:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_hash":"880ead46b7f73d2d02f5e54ec41f05096a5bf7ee1f508da062d406f3c9d781b4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}